   "label": "AI Overview Impressions",
   "hover": "Example 1 — factor group:4% of searches showed no AI Overview.Example 2 — comparison group:8% of searches showed no AI Overview.What the percentage means:The example shows +50%: pages with the factor went without an AI Overview half as often. Plus means the page's search showed an AI Overview more often; minus means it went without one more often. The column counts the rare side, searches with no AI Overview, because an AI Overview showed on 92% of all searches and the shown side cannot move.Source:DataForSEO ran the search for every one of the 20,000 pages in the August 2026 run; 18,345 searches showed an AI Overview and 1,655 did not. Backlink rows are blank because their backlink lists cover only pages from searches that showed an AI Overview."
  },
